{'symbol': 'ODFL', 'date': '2022-07-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE ANNOUNCES $0.30 PER SHARE QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'THOMASVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ODFL--OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE, INC. (NASDAQ: ODFL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 21, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 7, 2022. THIS DIVIDEND REPRESENTS A 50.0% INCREASE OVER THE DIVIDEND PAID IN SEPTEMBER 2021. FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS IN THIS NEWS RELEASE ARE MADE PURSUANT TO THE SAFE HARBOR PROVISIONS OF THE PRIVAT'}